Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=07e4ee52a6dff836c5a9db4b8e305c7f 3x"}, "body": "Hello, nice to meet you!! I really love the way you draw interactions between characters! I would like to request two characters, they belong to me and my friend.\n\n\ud83c\udf20 [1] 172cm. Blue dragon. Cool, friendly, calm. Always has his headphones on. A responsible guy. He lets loose around [2] and likes to tease him.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 [2] 165cm. Red phoenix. Confident, noisy, rude. His ears are feathers like a bird and he has a scar on his lip. He is a troublemaker and likes to bother [1].\n\nReferences URL: https://sta.sh/27k8itvipq6\n\nThey are freerunners! The two of them are rivals who argue and are romantically involved. Character [2\ud83d\udd25]  is normally annoyingly smug and not scared of anything, but he has a crippling fear of insects. When he sees a big bug he cries and runs to get Character [1\ud83c\udf20] to remove it... \ud83d\ude2d\n \nI will leave the pose and details up to you! Please draw freely. You can simplify or change the outfits. If there are any problems, feel free to decline!\n\nThank you for considering..! \ud83d\udc9e", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Cott100/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2504039, "client_id": 2221958, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bee3080f/uploads/origins/b8bb60b6-0c15-4a53-a6bc-3201edd02a0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8f729509b5df4c6f270022b290031fb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bee3080f/uploads/origins/b8bb60b6-0c15-4a53-a6bc-3201edd02a0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8f729509b5df4c6f270022b290031fb, https://si.imgix.net/bee3080f/uploads/origins/b8bb60b6-0c15-4a53-a6bc-3201edd02a0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&d